Statute text from the Connecticut General Assembly (https://www.cga.ct.gov). Statute text cannot be copyrighted (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, 590 U.S. 255 (2020)). The annotations, histories and editorial notes, which the State may claim, are not included. Source: Legislative Commissioners' Office, General Statutes of Connecticut, revisions of 2019, 2021, 2023 and 2025.

